  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>One of our top-requested features is&nbsp;available: the ability to forward your Azure Active Directory (Azure AD) logs to Azure Log Analytics. You can&nbsp;now browse, query, visualize, alert on, and do more with your Azure AD log data. For more information, see the <a href=\"https://aka.ms/AzureADLogAnalytics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">documentation</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/customercomms/media/azureupdates/_migrated/484dcecb-4d6e-4248-be72-7015f8330d31.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"LA_AAD_thumb[2]\" src=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/customercomms/media/azureupdates/_migrated/b62b0006-2200-4ca4-9a55-1c43b1fba28d.png\" title=\"LA_AAD_thumb[2]\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/customercomms/media/azureupdates/_migrated/e030f9db-8578-4fe0-ab70-d70aae713206.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"image_thumb[2]\" src=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/customercomms/media/azureupdates/_migrated/410471db-acaf-4417-bcd1-bf136a3d9540.png\" title=\"image_thumb[2]\"></a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "One of our top-requested features is available: the ability to forward your Azure Active Directory (Azure AD) logs to Azure Log Analytics. You can now browse, query, visualize, alert on, and do more with your Azure AD log data. For more information, see the documentation ."
  },
